## AI-Assisted

## Apply project-wide GitHub security/policy settings to the source
## organizations (Kicksecure, Whonix). Idempotent and reconciling: a
## setting the policy wants OFF is actively turned off, not left as found.
## Run `dm-github-org-policy --help` for the full settings list.

